@startuml
title A1 - Spremljanje brez spremembe parametrov

actor "Administrator" as Admin
boundary "AdminPametnaKomponentaMaska" as UI
control "AdminPametnaKontroler" as Controller
entity "PametnaKomponenta" as Smart
entity "MetrikeZgodovina" as MetricsHistory

Admin -> UI: odpre sekcijo "Pametna komponenta"
activate UI

UI -> Controller: pridobiMetrikeKakovosti(...)
activate Controller

Controller -> Smart: izračunajTrenutneMetrike()
activate Smart
Smart --> Controller: metrike
deactivate Smart

Controller -> MetricsHistory: pridobiZgodovinoMetrik()
activate MetricsHistory
MetricsHistory --> Controller: časovna vrsta
deactivate MetricsHistory

Controller --> UI: metrike + zgodovina
deactivate Controller

UI --> Admin: prikaže trende

== samo pregled, brez sprememb ==

Admin -> UI: pregleda podatke (brez sprememb)
Admin -> UI: zapre pogled

deactivate UI
@enduml